    "title": "Pets Tailor",
    "description": "Pet's Tailor Game is a creative and interactive role-playing game that allows players to step into the shoes of a virtual tailor. In this game pets come to shop and select any one items so you need to make perfect dress.\r\n\r\nIn this game, players assume the role of a skilled fashion designer and garment maker, taking on various challenges and tasks related to the art of tailoring.\r\n\r\nPlayers have the opportunity to design and create unique clothing items, ranging from elegant dresses to stylish suits, using a wide array of fabrics, patterns, and accessories. They can experiment with different colors, textures, and styles to bring their creative vision to life.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n===========\r\n\u2714 Easy to play stop by step.\r\n\u2714 Tons of colorful cloths style.\r\n\u2714 Real feeling tailor sawing machine.\r\n\u2714 Many different tools for make perfect cloths.\r\n\u2714 Many decorate item for tailor master.\r\n\r\nSo why are you waiting? Download Now....\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t forget review us!!",
